contentMarkdown:
The Land is an exquisite piece of wallet made of high quality Italian premium full grain leather. It comes with 4 slots for cards, and 2 big slots for bigger documents or passport.

You can carry one passport, a “carte grise” for french drivers, 4 to 8 cards, and a long document in the open side. The Land is perfect for travelers who need to carry their essentials with them at all times. It is compact and stylish, and its premium full grain waxed leather gives it an elegant, authentic and sophisticated look.

Overall, The Land is the perfect accessory for those who value quality and style. Its functionality make it an indispensable item for your travels, and even for everyday use.

For the crafters, you can find the original pattern [here](https://shop.crofte.fr/b/leather-passport-document-cardholder-pdf-template) if you want to make it yourself.

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

